hl.env("QT_QPA_PLATFORMTHEME", "qt6ct")
-- ponytail: compositor scale (kanshi, per-output) sizes everything; no global Qt/GDK scaling.
-- QT_SCALE_FACTOR/GDK_SCALE also hit Wayland-native Qt (Dolphin, jellyfin-desktop) -> ~2x too big,
-- and were wrong on scale-1/2.5 monitors. Wayland-native apps use the compositor scale natively.

